  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I have a version of  fedora 3.5 running that errors with",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "javax.ws.rs.WebApplicationException: org.fcrepo.server.errors.StreamWriteException: Error writing temp stream",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.server.rest.BaseRestResource.handleException(BaseRestResource.java:172)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.server.rest.DatastreamResource.addOrUpdateDatastream(DatastreamResource.java:583)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "…",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "when I write a file 2GB in size (1024*1024*2048) via the API:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "curl -H \"Content-type:application/octet-stream\" -X POST -u \"name:pass\" --upload-file 3g.data \\\n\t",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://host:8080/fedora/objects/scholarsphere:5425k9692/datastreams/blah?controlGroup=M"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://host:8080/fedora/objects/scholarsphere:5425k9692/datastreams/blah?controlGroup=M",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "But when I write a 2GB-1MB file (1024*1024*2047) via the API, it works without issue. Multipart uploads also do not work.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Ben Armintor has been working with me on this and first identified ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-704"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-704",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " as a potential starting place. He has since followed up with:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I've got a test verifying a bug in FCRepo 3.6 (and earlier) for content posted in the request body- I'll push a fix today (I think).  There are two places in the REST library in which signed ints are being used got content-length in the kind of upload you have:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/master/fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/rest/RestUtil.java#L74"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/master/fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/rest/RestUtil.java#L74",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "(where it's implicit in the j2ee interface, so we just have to ignore it and parse the header)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "and at ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/master/fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/rest/RestUtil.java#L63"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/master/fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/rest/RestUtil.java#L63",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "(our fault- that was clearly a place we missed when an earlier bug in this line was fixed 3 years ago).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
